{
  "$comment": "What the folder scanners detect (projects, vendors, and secrets: kinds and places only, never values), shared by the Python scanner (scope_gen.py, scan_folders.py) and the Rust laptop scanner (scanner/), and served at GET /v1/scanner-rules. Regexes use the syntax both Python and Rust accept: no lookarounds or backreferences. Patterns are matched at the start of the text unless they say otherwise.",
